  "notes": "Exact cardinal occlusion identity gate (#4955). NONE, FULL and POSITION_ONLY compare cull-off and cull-on against the committed reference frames at byte-exact thresholds. The NONE chunk-only arm isolates per-voxel refinement. Four standard poses are cardinal; three rotated poses exercise the unchanged path. Run occlusion-fire-verify alongside identity so a disabled cull cannot pass vacuously. Metal references are committed; OpenGL reference capture remains tracked by #3544. Never loosen thresholds or rebless an existing reference to pass this gate. STATIC-CYCLE PAIR: static_cycle and static_cycle_dynamic preserve the seven cycle_* reference labels and 48-frame settlement warmup. The static arm creates frozen cells with C_Static and thaws, moves and re-freezes every hundredth cell; the --no-static arm performs the same moves dynamically. The demo asserts settlement and, for static residents, empty pending position ranges, cull-cache chunks and stale light-grid boxes before capture."
